### API Testing File
### You can use this with REST Client extension in VS Code
### Or use these commands with curl in terminal

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@sessionId = test-session-123

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Get Product by ID (replace with actual ID from database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID

### Search Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/search?q=iphone

### Get Products by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/category/Mobile%20phone

### Get All Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Get Cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

### Add to Cart (replace productId with actual ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart
Content-Type: application/json
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

{
  "productId": "REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Update Cart Item
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cart/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID
Content-Type: application/json
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Remove from Cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

### Get Wishlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/wishlist
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

### Add to Wishlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/wishlist
Content-Type: application/json
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

{
  "productId": "REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID"
}

### Remove from Wishlist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/wishlist/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

### Create Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com",
    "phone": "1234567890",
    "address": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Mumbai",
    "state": "Maharashtra",
    "pincode": "400001"
  },
  "payment": {
    "method": "card"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Get All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Get Order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID
